# Terraform working files
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfplan
*.plan
tfplan*

# Local-only overrides and sensitive files (the .example is committed)
backend_override.tf
override.tf
*_override.tf
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example

# Ansible retry files
*.retry

# Never commit an MDE onboarding or offboarding package
**/mdatp_onboard.json
**/mdatp_offboard.json

# OS and editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.log
